 'Identify Threats: Threat Level, Risk Factor' links the 'Identify Threats' activity with the attributes 'Threat Level' and 'Risk Factor'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Implement Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity represents the execution of actions and measures designed to mitigate identified threats.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Cost of Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Cost of Countermeasures: float between 100.0 and 1000000.0' represents the financial cost of implementing countermeasures, ranging from 100.0 to 1000000.0.\",\"min_value\":100.0,\"max_value\":1000000.0,\"enumeration_values\":null},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Days to Respond\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Days to Respond: integer between 1 and 365' represents the number of days allocated for implementing countermeasures, ranging from 1 to 365.\",\"min_value\":1,\"max_value\":365,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Implement Countermeasures: Cost of Countermeasures, Days to Respond' links the 'Implement Countermeasures' activity with the attributes 'Cost of Countermeasures' and 'Days to Respond'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Report Findings\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Findings' activity includes compiling and presenting the results of intelligence analysis and monitoring efforts.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Report Status\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Report Status: Draft, Review, Final, Disseminated' specifies the possible statuses of an intelligence report, including Draft, Review, Final, and Disseminated.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Draft\",\"Review\",\"Final\",\"Disseminated\"]},{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Geographic Region\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Geographic Region: North America, Europe, Asia, Africa, South America' specifies the geographic regions relevant to the intelligence report, including 