t later in the same process instance. Conversely, an 'Identify Threats' event can occur only if an 'Analyze Data' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Analyze Data' impose obligations for future 'Identify Threats', and 'Identify Threats' cannot occur without prior 'Analyze Data'. Multiple 'Analyze Data' and 'Identify Threats' are allowed, with each 'Analyze Data' eventually leading to an 'Identify Threats' and each 'Identify Threats' being justified by a preceding 'Analyze Data'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining and interpreting the gathered intelligence data.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Threats\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity focuses on detecting and classifying potential threats based on the analyzed intelligence data.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Develop Strategies' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Identify Threats\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity focuses on detecting and classifying potential threats based on the analyzed intelligence data.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Develop Strategies\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity involves formulating plans and approaches to address identified threats.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity can occur only if it is immediately preceded by an 'Implement Countermeasures' activity, with no other activities occurring in between.\",\"template\":\"Chain Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Strategies\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity involves formulating plans and approaches to address identified threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Implement Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity represents the execution of actions and measures designed to mitigate identified threats.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever an 'Implement Countermeasures' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Monitor Activity' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between. The 'Monitor Activity' activity is allowed to happen isolated.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Implement Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity represents the execution of actions and measures designed to mitigate identified threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Activity' activity involves continuously observing and tracking activities to detect any changes or emerging threats.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor Activity' activity occurs, then a 'Report Findings' activity must occur after that 'Monitor Activity' event and before any subsequent 'Monitor Activity' occurs no other occurrence of 'Monitor Activity' is allowed between a 'Monitor Activity' and 'Report Findings'.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Activity' activity involves continuously observing and tracking activities to detect any changes or emerging threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Report Findings\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Findings' activity includes compiling and presenting the results of intelligence analysis and monitoring efforts.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Intelligence' activity can occur only if it was immediately preceded by a 'Disseminate Information' activity, and no other 'Disseminate Information' event is allowed between the 'Disseminate Information' and the 'Review Intelligence'.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Review Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Intelligence' activity entails re-evaluating previously gathered and analyzed intelligence to ensure accuracy and relevance.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity involves sharing intelligence findings and reports with relevant stakeholders and authorized parties.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity involves sharing intelligence findings and reports with relevant stakeholders and authorized parties.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Gather Intelligence' activity occurs, then 'Analyze Data' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice-versa. This mutual dependency ensures that both activities occur together within the process flow, meaning that intelligence cannot be gathered without subsequent analysis, and analysis cannot be performed without prior intelligence gathering.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents the process of collecting intelligence from various sources.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining and interpreting the gathered intelligence data.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null}]}"